{"id": "DeJxPwYRWjo", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Is your child scared to go on stage? 🦁\n\nAarav had ONE job in the school play: ROAR. Every time, out came… “mew.” 😅 The night before, Book 3 on his shelf went TING, and Maa Chandraghanta stepped out. Her bell taught him what every brave kid learns: you don't roar because you're brave. You ROAR… and THEN you're brave. 🔔\n\nMaa Chandraghanta, the third form of Durga, wears a moon-shaped bell on her forehead, and its sound sends every fear running. That's her story in our Book 3, *The Fierce Protector.*\n\n📚 Rishi Katha Books 1–3 (Shailputri, Brahmacharini, Chandraghanta): set of 3 for ₹500 at rishikatha.com (link in bio).\n\nWhat was YOUR role in the school play? Tree? King? Lion? Tell us below 👇 and tag a parent whose little one is about to go on stage. Save this for the night before Annual Day ✨\n\n#RishiKatha #Chandraghanta #Navadurga #Navratri #MaaDurga #KidsBooks #IndianMythology #BedtimeStories #StageFright #AnnualDay #ParentingIndia #IndianParents #MomsOfInstagram #PictureBooks #HinduMythologyForKids", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791289265, "like_count": 1675, "comment_count": 19, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1254048816904599a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 48.685, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMoTIh_8ulvugv5mShcluL-2pgHyaArmJlT5_WHKnbuctaCj7SHJ53m4Eo7xXSc5TAvLZkSCU5dv5F_IBY7Hgow3k25phXp-Veve3A.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdpwNvSbm_M9oy2jNrqAp_-GiXoNx53lPMAj3XDW77todlZLj9BDIA6CHdqDXvKiG2DLHnVtoB5EAF1KLFZosjzN&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=o6tzgmGwXucQ7kNvwG83fAF&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=efRmqklw87e4gOkAwfWkgg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSGT2R-gicAkI43IX6W8Yk4nFVL1z6Cn9_j